{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19304","headline":"和令狐相公春日寻花有怀白侍郎阁老 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公春日寻花有怀白侍郎阁老","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芳菲满雍州，鸾凤许同游。\n花迳须深入，时光不少留。\n色鲜由树嫩，枝亚爲房稠。\n静对仍持酒，高看特上楼。\n晴宜连夜赏，雨便一年休。\n共忆秋官处，余霞曲水头。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19304.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19304","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}